{"title": "Altar to Shar", "pageid": 44703, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Altar_to_Shar", "categories": ["Transcripts", "Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">      </p><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Altar to Shar</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Altar_to_Shar.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Altar to Shar.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Altar_to_Shar.png/300px-Altar_to_Shar.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Altar_to_Shar.png/300px-Altar_to_Shar.png.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Altar_to_Shar.png/599px-Altar_to_Shar.png.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Altar to Shar.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"167\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure></aside>\nThe <b>Altar to Shar</b> is an environmental object in the <a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_Shar\" title=\"Gauntlet of Shar\">Gauntlet of Shar</a> that the party can attempt to pray to receive the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nightsinger%27s_Favour_(Condition)\" title=\"Nightsinger's Favour (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nightsinger's Favour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nightsinger%27s_Favour_(Condition)\" title=\"Nightsinger's Favour (Condition)\">Nightsinger's Favour</a>.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>If interacted with, each party member can attempt to pray at the altar by passing a <a href=\"/wiki/Religion\" title=\"Religion\">Religion</a> check. To receive the buff, the interacting party must attempt one of the options below:\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[SHADOWHEART]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Offer prayer and devotion to the Dark Lady.</i></span>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[SHADOWHEART]&nbsp;[RELIGION]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Silently swear your body and soul to Shar. Give yourself over entirely.</i>&nbsp;(DC 14&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/20px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/30px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/40px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/20px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>)</span></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[EVIL CLERIC]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Shar is not your mistress, but she is worthy of respect. Offer her a prayer.</i></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[CLERIC OF SELÛNE]&nbsp;[PALADIN OF SELÛNE]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Selûne's rival, but also her sister. Offer a prayer of reconciliation.</i></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[RELIGION]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Pray at the altar.</i>&nbsp;(DC 14)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[WARLOCK]&nbsp;[DECEPTION]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Feign a prayer while your patron thieves the altar's magic.</i>&nbsp;(DC 14)&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-condition\"><i>(if not Shadowheart)</i></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n<p>All other options, including being a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cleric\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paladin\" title=\"Paladin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paladin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Paladin\" title=\"Paladin\">Paladin</a> of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp/20px-Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp/30px-Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp/40px-Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Selûne\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp/20px-Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Sel%C3%BBne_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Selûne</a>, failing the ability check, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/38px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/50px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a> having abandoned <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/20px-Shar_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/30px-Shar_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/40px-Shar_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp/20px-Shar_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Shar_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Shar</a> receive the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shar-Stricken_(Condition)\" title=\"Shar-Stricken (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shar-Stricken\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shar-Stricken_(Condition)\" title=\"Shar-Stricken (Condition)\">Shar-Stricken</a> debuff instead. However, if they are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self_(Condition)\" title=\"Disguise Self (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disguised\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Disguise_Self_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self_(Condition)\" title=\"Disguise Self (Condition)\">Disguised</a> prior, characters who are Clerics of Paladins of Selûne can still safely pray at Shar's altar and obtain her blessing, rather than her curse.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_quests\">Related quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daughter_of_Darkness\" title=\"Daughter of Darkness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daughter of Darkness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Daughter_of_Darkness\" title=\"Daughter of Darkness\">Daughter of Darkness</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Chosen_of_Shar\" title=\"The Chosen of Shar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Chosen of Shar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/The_Chosen_of_Shar\" title=\"The Chosen of Shar\">The Chosen of Shar</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li{margin:0;display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3w